&_nc_oc=AdrQ3zgdUCJPChftV8fujLcpKd1xNj1gYRTXfUHjNO6GURbnxhEgmGpIyqKnhVCOLoI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5L7KA5sMk5NPAJC4GRWz_Q2N_1P29TPqvEvU5q1umLBw&oe=6A170ABE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UwDsrYivDNYQ7kNvwF2wW0V&_nc_oc=Adq4vG0HppT7IQLo-i1y6AVl3HLr3cWUkSsgz-1a4-pl7AXVCnzMvxEXWNjCmwQWiBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7slFycLaXE91-d2YYILOEHkAk1UJGWHgw4oP3HBYKq3A&oe=6A16E37C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_IzIRPmLpYkQ7kNvwG9z8Jm&_nc_oc=Adq3JxNm3_dkv5YpPqNGZz8E0tW-HqzvIXmMdihukkXLCUsUeIDi8nyLCdmwgy8cD3M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7SURxWE1Db2IRQCh45izGW8zcxxHjGwC9l5YFUfDmlNA&oe=6A170207"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5fx86Ojj-JoQ7kNvwFW87ul&_nc_oc=AdrLJzfaztcJ0FzasPWRxUX99FURH9GFXbgcgbC5WN0Jk9T3PhdJG5iy8NLDxtcJ15c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5_PBqt7DEB1YyRPP89qbAqj6SIQbxm-wWS6oqSEMRMtg&oe=6A16EDD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c_1SFgKafccQ7kNvwETQCqj&_nc_oc=Adq0KHBCReurLGZM7l-1eg201lPcICZJLEY2ITjf5Z6UVuO4jy3SmwO-v6EOk0bHl-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5iGBsWmbL__glHLoDGJZMVrU6TtnBR3LZ7CDezsFL4KQ&oe=6A16FA64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.